[? if cyprus_campaign_version == 1 : [+ cyprus_campaign_report +] ?]

Historical source reference:

“Gentlemen, the news reaching us is extremely worrying. Turkey has embarked on another major occupation in Cyprus. Clerides can no longer bear it. The situation is extremely critical. Look at the maps: you will see the Turks' expansion of nearly one hundred square kilometres since 22 July. In these circumstances, the conference will continue without me. The Greek government cannot remain at this conference any longer...”

Mavros, quoted in Mehmet Ali Birand, 30 Sıcak Gün, PDF page 295 — English translation of the source excerpt.


- @historical: [+ cyprus_history_choice_historical +]
- @alternative: [+ cyprus_history_choice_alternative +]

